  "steps": [
    "Blend the skyr and silken tofu until smooth and keep aside.",
    "Heat the oil and add mustard seeds, cumin seeds, hing, urad dal, peanuts, and curry leaves. Once fragrant, add the garlic, green chilli, and onion, then sauté until the onion softens.",
    "Add the suji and roast it for 2–3 minutes until lightly golden.",
    "Bring 200ml water to a boil with the carrot, green peas, and raisins.",
    "Add the boiling water to the roasted suji and mix well.",
    "Stir in the skyr and tofu blend along with turmeric, red chilli powder, salt, and a little sweetener.",
    "Cook on low heat for 4–6 minutes, stirring continuously until the upma reaches a soft and creamy consistency."
  ],
